nodes.body:
@BBuf CI has finished, and the new test passed on MI300 (AMD stage-b, 1-gpu-small). 

The remaining failures look unrelated to this PR: test_dsv4_hip_bcg_metadata.py has been broken on main since #44952 (its mock lacks swa_req_ring_size), test_score_api.py missed its performance threshold (67.9 vs ≤ 60), the MI35X disaggregation test ran out of memory, Intel's test_crash_dump.py was killed, and the NPU diffusion test failed its performance check. 

Could you merge when convenient? Thanks!

